# 8299 PROC AUCTION
# OR AUCTIONS, PLAYERS SHOULD HAVE THEIR CASH AND BANK AMOUNT AVAILABLE
# OR AUCTIONS IN EW ORK, PLAYERS MUST HAVE OLLARS IN THEIR ACCOUNT.
# UCTION OVERVIEW SHOULD ALSO SHOW THE CALLING PRICE AND WHAT THE PLAYER HAS
# AVAILABLE.
# UCTIONS START AUTOMATICALLY WHEN THE DATE HAS COME, BEFORE ANY PLAYER GETS
# TO THEIR TURN.
# EFORE THE AUCTION STARTS, PLAYERS CAN CHOSE TO OPT-IN OR OUT.
# F NO PLAYER PARTICIPATES, THE AUCTION ACTION SEQUENCE IS SKIPPED


8000  AA$="QWERNX"+""

8305  POKE 650,128

8310  FSB:FR=32:SYSFM,FR

8320  FR=31:SYSFM,FR:FRS
8330  PRINT AT(BY+1,BX+14) DUP("",15);
8340  FORX=0TO3:PRINT AT(BY+3+4*X,BX+1)PN$(X);
8350   PRINT AT(BY+1+4*X,BX+1) MID$(AA$,X+1,1);
8360  NEXT

8370  FORX=1TO4
8375   MMOB X,XM(2)+32,YM(2)+3+32*X
8380   MOB SET X,12,1,0,0,0
8385   PB%(X-1)=0
8390  NEXT
# COVERING THIS IN THE LOOP ABOVE
#8330  FORX=0TO3:PB%(X)=0:NEXT

8400  FR=33:SYSFM,FR:FRS

8405  PRINT AT(0,38) "A";

8410  KEYGET I$

# SA:AUCTION TIMER. SHOULD VARY SPEED
# SV:TIMER SPEED. 20 JIFFIES PER DEFAULT
# CD:COUNT-DOWN. HOW MANY LINES THE TIMER BAR HAS
8415  SA=TI:CD=15:SV=20


# AIN=AUCTION INPUT
8419 PROC AIN
8421  SYS FM+9:I=PEEK($FB)

8422  PRINT AT(5,37) DUP(" ",15-CD)DUP("",CD);

8423  IF TI-SA<SV THEN CALL CHKIN
#8424  SV=20
8425  CD=CD-1:IF CD<0 THEN CALL FINWIN
8438  SA=TI

8439 PROC CHKIN
8440  IF (IAND1)=1 THEN PB=0:MOGUY
8441  IF (IAND2)=2 THEN PB=1:MOGUY
8442  IF (IAND4)=4 THEN PB=2:MOGUY

8445  CALL AIN

#AA$=AUCTION ACTION KEYS (QWERNX)
#8440  PB=PLACE(I$,AA$)-1
#8442  IF PB<0 THEN 8420
#8444  IF PB<4 THEN MOGUY:GOTO 8420
#8446  IF PB=4 THEN 8370
#8448  IF PB<>5 THEN 8420

#AUCTION IS OVER
# FIND WINNER
8449 PROC FINWIN
8450  PB=0:FORX=0TO3
8452   IF PB%(X)>PB%(PB) THEN PB=X
8454  NEXT
8455  PRINT AT(17,16) "EWINNER: "PN$(PB);

# DISPLAY HAPPY SPRITE
8460  T1=TI:REPEAT

8462  MOB SET PB+1,12,1,0,0,0
8464  TS=TI:REPEAT:UNTIL TI-TS>10
8466  MOB SET PB+1,13,1,0,0,0
8468  TS=TI:REPEAT:UNTIL TI-TS>10

8469  UNTIL TI-T1>180

#PRINT AT(BY+BH-2,BX+1) "TASTE";
#     RELATIVE TO "EBOT VON" FRAME
8490  CY=-2:CX=25:TX=75:CPX

8500  POKE650,0:POKE198,0:DO NULL

8510  MOBOFF1:MOBOFF2:MOBOFF3:MOBOFF4

8520  CALL RTS

8530 END


8940 PROC MOGUY
8945  
8950  PB%(PB)=PB%(PB)+5:SA=TI
8960  MMOB PB+1,XM(2)+32+PB%(PB),YM(2)+3+32*(PB+1)
8970  MOB SET PB+1,6+(PB%(PB)AND1),1,0,0,0

8980 END PROC



